+/* MGVF mgvf-0019: the default deadband for a pad on a radio, in steps of 255.
+ *
+ * Zero on a cable, where a write costs 1-2 ms and there is nothing to ration.
+ * Four over Bluetooth, where the link carries about 65 reports a second and 76%
+ * of the packets this driver was sending moved a motor by less than this. Four
+ * is 1.6% of a motor's range. Measured on Beast of Reincarnation: 3-5 fps and
+ * visible stutter became 2 fps and none, with the rumble unchanged to the hand
+ * that had been complaining about it. */
+#define DUALSENSE_HAPTICS_BT_DEADBAND      4
